    "vs_reference_arm": "the reference arm is the untouched host; this candidate adds one term whose gradient reaches the codebook without pulling a transition's two codewords together"
  },
  "equation": "\u4ee4 u_i=(t_i-s_i)/(||t_i-s_i||+eps)\uff0c\u4ee4 c_i \u4e3a codebook \u4e2d\u8ddd t_i \u6700\u8fd1\u7684\u7801\u5b57\uff0c\u4ee4 P_i=I-c_i c_i^T/(||c_i||^2+eps)\u3002\u5b9a\u4e49 L=weight\u00b7mean_i mask_i\u00b7[-u_i^T P_i(c_i-s_i)+repel\u00b7max(0,sep-||c_i-c_j||)^2]\uff0c\u5176\u4e2d j \u662f\u8ddd c_i \u6700\u8fd1\u7684\u5176\u4ed6\u7801\u5b57\uff1b\u7a7a\u63a9\u7801\u65f6 L=0\u3002",
